# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# ── Canonical host ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Force www -> apex so the two hosts don't serve as independent copies
# of the site (duplicate-content / split-authority issue). Requires
# www.mcc-solutionsnj.com to be added as a Custom Domain on this Pages
# project (Cloudflare Pages > your project > Custom domains) — a
# redirect rule can only fire for traffic that actually reaches Pages.
https://www.mcc-solutionsnj.com/*  https://mcc-solutionsnj.com/:splat  301!

# ── Index-page canonicalization ─────────────────────────────────────
# Without this, "/" and "/index.html" (and a hypothetical "/index.php")
# serve identical content as two separate 200 URLs — flagged as a
# duplicate/"accessible index page" issue by SEO auditors.
/index.html  /  301
/index.php   /  301
